#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.brief"
msgid "{keymasterFirst} creates a Document Signer Certificate (DSC) signed by the SCA, offline, and wraps it in a CMS package to upload to PROD. The test then checks the trust list, revokes a DSC, and the results go to the service provider by email."
msgstr "{keymasterFirst} 离线创建一个由 SCA 签名的文件签名者证书（DSC），并将其封装为 CMS 包以上传到 PROD。随后测试会检查信任列表、吊销一个 DSC，结果通过电子邮件发送给服务提供方。"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.choices.sca.consequence.by"
msgid "PROD gateway"
msgstr "PROD 网关"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.choices.sca.consequence.title"
msgid "Upload rejected"
msgstr "上传被拒"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.choices.sca.consequence.travel.label"
msgid "CMS package"
msgstr "CMS 包"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.choices.sca.consequence.what"
msgid "The Gateway rejected the package."
msgstr "网关拒绝了该数据包。"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.choices.sca.consequence.why"
msgid "The SCA signs the DSC itself, offline. The package around it is signed with the Upload certificate."
msgstr "SCA 离线为 DSC 本身签名。包裹它的数据包则用上传证书签名。"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.choices.sca.text"
msgid "The SCA"
msgstr "SCA"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.choices.tls.consequence.by"
msgid "PROD gateway"
msgstr "PROD 网关"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.choices.tls.consequence.title"
msgid "Upload rejected"
msgstr "上传被拒"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.choices.tls.consequence.travel.label"
msgid "CMS package"
msgstr "CMS 包"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.choices.tls.consequence.what"
msgid "The Gateway rejected the package."
msgstr "网关拒绝了该数据包。"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.choices.tls.consequence.why"
msgid "Packages are signed with the Upload certificate. TLS only opens the connection."
msgstr "数据包用上传证书签名。TLS 只负责建立连接。"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.choices.tls.text"
msgid "The TLS certificate"
msgstr "TLS 证书"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.choices.upload.text"
msgid "The Upload certificate"
msgstr "上传证书"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.docs.0.lines.0"
msgid "a) Create a DSC, signed by the SCA"
msgstr "a) 创建一个由 SCA 签名的 DSC"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.docs.0.lines.1"
msgid "b) Wrap it in a CMS package"
msgstr "b) 将其封装为 CMS 包"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.docs.0.lines.2"
msgid "c) Upload the package to the PROD gateway"
msgstr "c) 将数据包上传到 PROD 网关"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.docs.0.lines.3"
msgid "d) Download the trust list and check your DSC is there"
msgstr "d) 下载信任列表并检查你的 DSC 在其中"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.docs.0.lines.4"
msgid "e) Delete (revoke) at least one DSC"
msgstr "e) 删除（吊销）至少一个 DSC"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.docs.0.lines.5"
msgid "f) Upload it again if the DSC is needed"
msgstr "f) 如仍需要该 DSC，重新上传"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.docs.0.lines.6"
msgid "Then: email the results to the service provider"
msgstr "然后：通过电子邮件把结果发送给服务提供方"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.docs.0.title"
msgid "Production Readiness Test"
msgstr "生产就绪测试"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.docs.1.title"
msgid "Build the CMS package"
msgstr "构建 CMS 包"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.learn"
msgid "In production, the SCA signs the DSC and the Upload certificate signs the package. The test also revokes a DSC, and the results go by email."
msgstr "在生产环境中，SCA 为 DSC 签名，上传证书为数据包签名。测试还会吊销一个 DSC，结果通过电子邮件发送。"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.prompt"
msgid "Which certificate signs the CMS package?"
msgstr "哪个证书为 CMS 包签名？"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.success.note"
msgid "Production Readiness Test passed. A confirmation email tells {country} and WHO that onboarding is complete."
msgstr "生产就绪测试通过。一封确认邮件告知 {country} 和世卫组织入网已完成。"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.success.travel.0.label"
msgid "CMS package (DSC)"
msgstr "CMS 包（DSC）"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.success.travel.1.label"
msgid "Trust list: {code} DSC present"
msgstr "信任列表：{code} 的 DSC 已在列"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.success.travel.2.label"
msgid "Delete a DSC (revocation)"
msgstr "删除一个 DSC（吊销）"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.success.travel.3.label"
msgid "DSC uploaded again"
msgstr "DSC 已重新上传"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.success.travel.4.label"
msgid "Test results by email"
msgstr "测试结果已通过电子邮件发送"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.success.travel.5.label"
msgid "Onboarding complete"
msgstr "入网完成"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:prod.title"
msgid "Production readiness test"
msgstr "生产就绪测试"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:renew.brief"
msgid "{country} is live. Its certificates expire: recommended validity is about 4 years for the SCA, 2 for a DSC, and 1 to 2 for Upload and TLS. WHO's certificate expiry dashboard (one each for DEV, UAT and PROD) shows {country}'s Upload certificate has 21 days left."
msgstr "{country} 已上线。它的证书会过期：建议有效期为 SCA 约 4 年、DSC 2 年、上传和 TLS 证书 1 至 2 年。世卫组织的证书到期仪表板（DEV、UAT 和 PROD 各一个）显示，{country} 的上传证书还剩 21 天。"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:renew.choices.us.text"
msgid "We do. We track expiry ourselves, renew in good time (for example a month before expiry) and send WHO the new certificate"
msgstr "我们自己。我们自行跟踪到期时间，提前更新（例如在到期前一个月），并把新证书发送给世卫组织"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:renew.choices.who.consequence.by"
msgid "The network"
msgstr "网络"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:renew.choices.who.consequence.title"
msgid "Expired"
msgstr "已过期"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:renew.choices.who.consequence.what"
msgid "{country}'s Upload and TLS certificates expired. Uploads stopped and the backend lost its connection."
msgstr "{country} 的上传证书和 TLS 证书已过期。上传停止，后端失去连接。"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:renew.choices.who.consequence.why"
msgid "The dashboard shows expiry dates, but no one sends reminders: each participant tracks its own certificates. Upload and TLS certificates must be renewed in good time, for example a month before expiry, and the new ones sent to WHO."
msgstr "仪表板显示到期日期，但没有人发送提醒：每个参与方自行跟踪自己的证书。上传证书和 TLS 证书必须提前更新，例如在到期前一个月，并将新证书发送给世卫组织。"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:renew.choices.who.text"
msgid "WHO will send a reminder before anything expires"
msgstr "世卫组织会在任何证书过期前发送提醒"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:renew.docs.0.lines.0"
msgid "SCA|1100"
msgstr "SCA|1100"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:renew.docs.0.lines.1"
msgid "DSC|540"
msgstr "DSC|540"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:renew.docs.0.lines.2"
msgid "TLS client|330"
msgstr "TLS 客户端|330"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:renew.docs.0.lines.3"
msgid "Upload|21"
msgstr "上传|21"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:renew.docs.0.title"
msgid "Certificate expiry · PROD · {code}"
msgstr "证书到期 · PROD · {code}"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:renew.learn"
msgid "Renewing certificates on time is {country}'s job for as long as it stays in the network."
msgstr "只要还在网络中，按时更新证书就是 {country} 的工作。"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:renew.prompt"
msgid "Who makes sure they are renewed in time?"
msgstr "谁来确保按时更新？"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:renew.success.note"
msgid "New Upload certificate made and sent to WHO. Renewal dates are in the team calendar."
msgstr "已制作新的上传证书并发送给世卫组织。更新日期已写入团队日历。"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
msgctxt "scenario:renew.title"
msgid "Stay live"
msgstr "保持在线"

#: onboarding-game/src/i18n/en.json:1
